  "question": {
    "text": "If $A$ is a square matrix of order 3 , then $\\mid \\operatorname{Adj}(\\operatorname{Adj}$ $\\left.A^2\\right) \\mid=$"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$|A|^2$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$|A|^4$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$|A|^8$",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "$|\\mathrm{A}|^{16}$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\left|\\operatorname{adj}\\left(\\operatorname{adj} A^2\\right)\\right|=$\n$|\\operatorname{adj} \\mathrm{A}|=|\\mathrm{A}|^{n-1}=|\\mathrm{A}|^2$\n$\\left|\\operatorname{adj} A^2\\right|=|\\operatorname{adj} A|^2=\\left(|A|^2\\right)^2=|A|^4$\n$\\left|\\operatorname{adj}\\left(\\operatorname{adj} A^2\\right)\\right|=\\left(|A|^4\\right)^{3-1}$\n$=\\left(|A|^4\\right)^2=|A|^8$"
  }
}